title: Let two suites run at once, by copying the integration fixtures instead of editing them in place.
pid: c0258584-7cf4-4311-b086-fdb2ababccf4
body: |2-
  That would end the waiting between sessions: at least 20 minutes of
  1,315 in five days (under 2% of working time so far), more as more
  missions build. The cost is a change to the integration harness, a
  few hours of Claude's work (an estimate).
